# Digital twin

Model sites hierarchically:

Site → Building → Floor → Zone → Camera/Sensor → Safety Event

Twin views should eventually support spatial mapping, zone polygons, camera placement, live status, incidents, and historical events.

No digital-twin implementation exists yet. Do not invent GeoJSON or map schemas that are not in `docs/DIGITAL_TWIN.md`.

Persist spatial entities in PostgreSQL with versioned migrations when this feature is built.
